window.bookSummaryJSON = "Pixie Pearson, ex-army, now turned private investigator has a new case. Her usual cases involve straying husbands, but it's a lost pet this time. Hot on the trail of the cute white pup with one black eye. She is besieged by pets, photocopiers, and kilt-wearing men. Follow Pixie's pursuit of dog nappers in this cosy crime story. This short, sharp, quick introduction to Pixie's life is the first in a series.<br><br>Tropes<ul><li>Disaster Zone</li><li>Hardboiled Detective</li><li>Hidden Identity</li><li>Found Family</li><li>Criminal Mastermind</li><li>Uncovered Love</li><li>Woman Sleuth</li></ul>"; 
